And plan for the big items.

283
00:10:49,003 --> 00:10:52,214
Brakes, batteries, shocks and tires do not

284
00:10:52,214 --> 00:10:53,743
wear out every year,

285
00:10:53,743 --> 00:10:55,042
but when they do,

286
00:10:55,042 --> 00:10:56,724
the bill can be large.

287
00:10:56,904 --> 00:11:00,015
Setting aside money each month for maintenance,

288
00:11:00,015 --> 00:11:02,000
as if it were a small payment,

289
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:04,648
makes those bills much easier to handle.

290
00:11:04,997 --> 00:11:07,352
Hidden cost number five is fuel,

