Fuel averaged seventeen point three cents a

299
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:29,077
mile across all vehicles.

300
00:11:29,426 --> 00:11:30,843
And then it got worse.

301
00:11:31,023 --> 00:11:32,370
According to AAA,

302
00:11:32,370 --> 00:11:33,876
as reported by NPR,

